{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42038","headline":"和友人喜雪 · 李中","name":"和友人喜雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"腊雪频频降，成堆不可除。\n伴吟花莫并，销瘴药何如。\n谢女诗成处，袁安睡起初。\n深迷樵子径，冷逼旅人居。\n惹砌催罇俎，飘窗入簿书。\n最宜楼上望，散乱满空虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}